{"headword":"עָלֶה","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.m. leaf, leafage (</strong>v. <span dir=\"rtl\">עלה</span> <strong>Qal 4)</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 26:36\" href=\"/Leviticus.26.36\">Lv 26:36</a> +; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲלֵה</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 3:7\" href=\"/Genesis.3.7\">Gn 3:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 8:11\" href=\"/Genesis.8.11\">8:11</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">עָלֵהוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 17:8\" href=\"/Jeremiah.17.8\">Je 17:8</a> +; pl. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲלֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 8:15\" href=\"/Nehemiah.8.15\">Ne 8:15</a> +; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">עָלֶהָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 1:30\" href=\"/Isaiah.1.30\">Is 1:30</a>;—<em>leaf, leafage</em>, of various trees <a data-ref=\"Genesis 3:7\" href=\"/Genesis.3.7\">Gn 3:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 8:11\" href=\"/Genesis.8.11\">8:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 8:15\" href=\"/Nehemiah.8.15\">Ne 8:15</a><sup>(×5)</sup>; green <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 17:8\" href=\"/Jeremiah.17.8\">Je 17:8</a>, flourishing <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 11:28\" href=\"/Proverbs.11.28\">Pr 11:28</a>; but usually fading <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 1:30\" href=\"/Isaiah.1.30\">Is 1:30</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 34:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.34.4\">34:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 64:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.64.5\">64:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 8:13\" href=\"/Jeremiah.8.13\">Je 8:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 47:12\" href=\"/Ezekiel.47.12\">Ez 47:12</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 1:3\" href=\"/Psalms.1.3\">ψ 1:3</a>; <em>driven leaf</em> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 26:36\" href=\"/Leviticus.26.36\">Lv 26:36</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 13:25\" href=\"/Job.13.25\">Jb 13:25</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">עלה לִתְרוּפָה</span> <em>leaf for healing</em> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 47:12\" href=\"/Ezekiel.47.12\">Ez 47:12</a>."}]},"rid":"BDB07294","strong_numbers":["5929"],"next_hw":"עֱלִי","prev_hw":"עָלָה","all_cited":true,"quotes":[],"GK":["6591"],"TWOT":["1624a"],"parent_lex